{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:08:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_5c8adff1342a48fd938b8e7e0abf62b9","id":"pg_5d7c9b2c9da45c8e9eb31f83dc642a74","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/gptme-gptme-docs-memory-rst-7c8570587edc-1f83dc642a74.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_effa5aca9b005333a4482793403efe0f"],"title":"gptme/gptme/docs/memory.rst @ 7c8570587edc","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:08:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5c8adff1342a48fd938b8e7e0abf62b9"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_06f85b571f71704697f3057e8dac076f4b59693cc73d3df97f8db4caacaa5c90"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"gptme is a chat-CLI for LLMs; prompts can be passed as arguments and chained with a '-' separator, and the interface exposes user commands like /undo, /log, /model, /tools, and /export."},{"claim_ids":["clm_27100d8782b57502b925fb39d87f11290a850997efae4497b8c69b7c37f4e1c1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Via the Agent Client Protocol (ACP) extra, gptme can act as a drop-in coding agent in Zed and JetBrains IDEs, executing with its full toolset and streaming results back to the editor."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2ecdabf1d064bf9953fdf56791803544703e140d44cabc354e947f160fdba08a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Non-interactive mode with --output-format json emits one JSON object per line on stdout for machine-readable use in CI or supervising processes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_38265c4f86bd3e9f20fdc60698b51710cd369ec0b7da529e0dd6fe60c6e283e1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The gptme-agent-template supports persistent autonomous agents with a git-tracked workspace, run loops, task queues, multi-agent coordination via file leases and a message bus, and external integrations like GitHub and Discord."},{"claim_ids":["clm_64da5b32418af0b58c78f7f95169943cec19833ca4f846b15b17c3b070f086d2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"gptme service init scaffolds a self-contained headless agent: a systemd service unit, optional timer (hourly/daily/weekly/on-demand), a startup script running one non-interactive session per trigger, prompt.md, and config skeletons."},{"claim_ids":["clm_80ef585ff87afec9811fb4467069eb6be1c0d9ce71033f5509d5370f0831efea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented provider support covers Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, DeepSeek, OpenRouter, and local llama.cpp servers, configured via per-provider API keys or an OpenAI-compatible base URL."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a23780e490e14f19c4cd358ac9c8329ace54adb27cfbf6ed0a7868dc6b7960bc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Built-in tools documented include shell, ipython, read, save/append, patch/morph, browser (Playwright), vision, screenshot, rag, gh, tmux, computer, subagent, and chats."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a4bb7762d27e5b264998c3d7b05c5625fa5cd8eaf94234f68d94d053ec5ff626"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README advertises an evaluation suite for testing capabilities of different models, with advanced frontier-capability evals listed as in progress."},{"claim_ids":["clm_adb3136b27261a0d2c5076a7883bf727d0db5d721cd41d918b33ba520eda3096"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Requires Python 3.10 or newer and credentials for at least one LLM provider; local llama.cpp models need no API key, and OpenRouter offers a no-credit-card free-model path."},{"claim_ids":["clm_afb8418de9a18c821434eaf870a492d72a40b26c8cac29d0672ce82d6932f70e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"CLI options include --model, --workspace, --resume, --no-confirm (-y), --non-interactive (-n), --output-format text|json, --system, and a --tools flag restricting tools to a comma-separated allowlist."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d7b610b520ad8c3848d15aee992984caf97f1aec4ef57a24ac802c8804bf716f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the README says contributions are welcome and points contributors to the contributing guide at gptme.org/docs/contributing.html; it also notes the codebase is checked and formatted with mypy, ruff, and pyupgrade."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ef24c26595d1e9f762dcaed6f6ef7c80db6f5706db7108847f51a1d98291f34f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Extensibility layers include Python-package plugins configured in gptme.toml, Anthropic-format skills that auto-load when named, keyword/pattern-matched lessons injected into conversations, and lifecycle hooks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fe7cec872a5cce12f964460b261da8bf6d4e6b4b06e58e9f43571c237f6b1a32"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"gptme works bidirectionally with MCP: as a client it discovers and loads external MCP servers as tools, and as a server (gptme-mcp-server) it exposes shell, Python, and file tools to MCP clients with state preserved across calls."}],"claim_ids":["clm_06f85b571f71704697f3057e8dac076f4b59693cc73d3df97f8db4caacaa5c90","clm_27100d8782b57502b925fb39d87f11290a850997efae4497b8c69b7c37f4e1c1","clm_2ecdabf1d064bf9953fdf56791803544703e140d44cabc354e947f160fdba08a","clm_38265c4f86bd3e9f20fdc60698b51710cd369ec0b7da529e0dd6fe60c6e283e1","clm_64da5b32418af0b58c78f7f95169943cec19833ca4f846b15b17c3b070f086d2","clm_80ef585ff87afec9811fb4467069eb6be1c0d9ce71033f5509d5370f0831efea","clm_a23780e490e14f19c4cd358ac9c8329ace54adb27cfbf6ed0a7868dc6b7960bc","clm_a4bb7762d27e5b264998c3d7b05c5625fa5cd8eaf94234f68d94d053ec5ff626","clm_adb3136b27261a0d2c5076a7883bf727d0db5d721cd41d918b33ba520eda3096","clm_afb8418de9a18c821434eaf870a492d72a40b26c8cac29d0672ce82d6932f70e","clm_d7b610b520ad8c3848d15aee992984caf97f1aec4ef57a24ac802c8804bf716f","clm_ef24c26595d1e9f762dcaed6f6ef7c80db6f5706db7108847f51a1d98291f34f","clm_fe7cec872a5cce12f964460b261da8bf6d4e6b4b06e58e9f43571c237f6b1a32"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:08:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_5c8adff1342a48fd938b8e7e0abf62b9","id":"pg_71ce16a56b135e3f8c8ac74490f7a5f1","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/gptme-gptme-readme-md-7c8570587edc-c74490f7a5f1.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_a52c921c36a35503aff68e1b257dc8a0"],"title":"gptme/gptme/README.md @ 7c8570587edc","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:08:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5c8adff1342a48fd938b8e7e0abf62b9"}
